  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Feed HANSEL and GRETEL to 10 fullness before the 100-second timer ends.


    WASD
    or arrow keys: move. Your last movement sets your aim.

    The small glowing
    candy beside the witch shows your throwing direction.

    SPACE: throw a candy. 
    1 / 2 / 3 or click: choose a card.

    The used card is replaced by a new random
    candy.


    GUMMIES: +1 fullness, no suspicion

    LOLLIPOP: +2 fullness, no
    suspicion

    CHOCOLATE: +3 fullness, +1 suspicion

    At 6 suspicion, the
    children escape!


    ESC or PAUSE: pause. Your wins and best time are saved.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
